# Rust build output
/target
**/*.rs.bk

# WebKit inspector protocol material — kept LOCAL ONLY, never committed.
# Regenerating `mjx-wk-protocol` requires these present locally; the generated
# output under crates/mjx-wk-protocol/src/generated/ IS committed.
# See reference/README.md for how to repopulate.
/reference/webkit-protocol/
/reference/chromium-protocol/
/reference/*.js

